4, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 86.0, "text": "小林走在沿線的街道上，思考著。"}, {"t": 86.264, "kind": "generationComplete", "audio_s": 86.0}, {"t": 86.264, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 86.0}, {"t": 86.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 86.5}, {"t": 86.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 87.0}, {"t": 87.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 87.5}, {"t": 87.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 88.0}, {"t": 88.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 88.5}, {"t": 88.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 89.0}, {"t": 89.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 89.5}, {"t": 89.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 90.0}, {"t": 90.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 90.5}, {"t": 90.979, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 91.0}, {"t": 91.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 91.5}, {"t": 91.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 92.0}, {"t": 92.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 92.5}, {"t": 92.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 93.0}, {"t": 93.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 93.5}, {"t": 93.979, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 94.0}, {"t": 94.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 94.5}, {"t": 94.766, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 94.5, "text": "環境 汚染 が 進む 街中 で は なく 、 空気 の 綺麗 な 郊外 に こそ 人 の 暮らし が ある べき で は ない だろう か と 。"}, {"t": 94.766, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 94.5, "text": "他想，人們的生活不應該是在環境污染日益嚴重的市中心，而應該是在空氣清新的郊區才對吧。"}, {"t": 94.766, "kind": "generationComplete", "audio_s": 94.5}, {"t": 94.766, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 94.5}, {"t": 94.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 95.0}, {"t": 95.479, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 95.5}, {"t": 95.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 96.0}, {"t": 96.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 96.5}, {"t": 96.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 97.0}, {"t": 97.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 97.5}, {"t": 97.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 98.0}, {"t": 98.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 98.5}, {"t": 98.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 99.0}, {"t": 99.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 99.5}, {"t": 99.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 100.0}, {"t": 100.481, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 100.5}, {"t": 100.98, "kind": 