0}, {"t": 116.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 116.5}, {"t": 116.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.0}, {"t": 117.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 117.5}, {"t": 117.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.0}, {"t": 118.479, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 118.5}, {"t": 118.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.0}, {"t": 119.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 119.5}, {"t": 119.981, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 120.0}, {"t": 120.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 120.5}, {"t": 120.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 121.0}, {"t": 121.479, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 121.5}, {"t": 121.979, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 122.0}, {"t": 122.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 122.5}, {"t": 122.717, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 122.5, "text": "周辺 に は 病院 、 学校 と 日常 生活 に 必要 な 場 も 作ら れ 発展 し て いく 。"}, {"t": 122.717, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 122.5, "text": "周邊也興建了醫院、學校等日常生活所需的場所，並持續發展。"}, {"t": 122.717, "kind": "generationComplete", "audio_s": 122.5}, {"t": 122.718, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 122.5}, {"t": 122.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 123.0}, {"t": 123.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 123.5}, {"t": 123.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 124.0}, {"t": 124.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 124.5}, {"t": 124.979, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 125.0}, {"t": 125.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 125.5}, {"t": 125.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 126.0}, {"t": 126.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 126.5}, {"t": 126.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 127.0}, {"t": 127.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 127.5}, {"t": 127.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 128.0}, {"t": 128.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 128.5}, {"t": 128.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 129.0}, {"t": 129.352, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 129.0, "text": "さらに 小林 は 住宅 を 分割 で 購入 できる ローン の 仕組み を 作り出し た 。"}, {"t": 129.352, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 129.0, "text": "此外，小林還開創了可以分期付款購買住宅的貸款機制。"}, {"t": 129.353, "kind": "generationComplete", "audio_s": 129.0}, {"t": 129.353, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 