8, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 146.0}, {"t": 146.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 146.5}, {"t": 146.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 147.0}, {"t": 147.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 147.5}, {"t": 147.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 148.0}, {"t": 148.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 148.5}, {"t": 148.716, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 148.5, "text": "こうして富裕層だけではなく、一般サラリーマンでも郊外に家を持てるようになり、郊外から電車に乗って会社へ通勤するというライフスタイルが定着し、安定した乗客数を見込めるようになった。"}, {"t": 148.717, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 148.5, "text": "就這樣，不僅是富裕階層，一般的上班族也能在郊外擁有自己的房子，從郊外搭電車通勤到公司的生活方式逐漸普及，也因此能確保穩定的乘客數量。"}, {"t": 148.717, "kind": "generationComplete", "audio_s": 148.5}, {"t": 148.717, "kind": "turnComplete", "audio_s": 148.5}, {"t": 148.981, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 149.0}, {"t": 149.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 149.5}, {"t": 149.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 150.0}, {"t": 150.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 150.5}, {"t": 150.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 151.0}, {"t": 151.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 151.5}, {"t": 151.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 152.0}, {"t": 152.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 152.5}, {"t": 152.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 153.0}, {"t": 153.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 153.5}, {"t": 153.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 154.0}, {"t": 154.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 154.5}, {"t": 154.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 155.0}, {"t": 155.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 155.5}, {"t": 155.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 156.0}, {"t": 156.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 156.5}, {"t": 156.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 157.0}, {"t": 157.48, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 157.5}, {"t": 157.98, "kind": "audio", "audio_s": 157.894}, {"t": 158.354, "kind": "inputTranscription", "audio_s": 157.894, "text": "仕事 と 暮らし の 場 を 分ける と いう 斬新 な アプローチ は 成功 し 、 現在 も 続く ライフ スタイル の スタンダード と なっ て いる 。"}, {"t": 158.354, "kind": "outputTranscription", "audio_s": 157.894, "text": "將工作與生活場所分開的新穎做法大獲成功，成為延續至今的生活方式標準。"}, {"t": 158.48, "kind": "audioStreamEnd_sent", "audio_s": 